# Auto-generated by SCR Editor
# Edit below and press Apply, or use the viewport tools.

builtin pointlights 1

# ---- global illumination + light options
gi screen         # on-screen GI uses screen traces; BVH fallback is sparse (N cycles modes, H toggles fallback 1/8)
gi offscreen 4    # hardware BVH fallback: trace 1 in 8 missed/off-screen GI rays per frame
area on           # off: emissive panels stop emitting, only point / spot / sun lights remain

# ---- NRD denoising + collisions
denoise 4         # 0 = off, any positive value enables NRD (B toggles it while running)

# Optional first-person controls: uncomment to enable WASD + mouse look + jump.
#builtin player
# Example invisible, editable box collider:
# collider hallway_wall pos 0 1.5 -4 size 8 3 0.2

#camera pos 2 3.5 0
#camera look 0 0
#builtin player

# ---- DLSS Super Resolution
dlss off      # off, quality, balanced, performance, ultra-performance, ultra-quality

